   "released": "2026-10-13",
   "changes": [
    {
     "kind": "minor",
     "description": "Renamed from `nearest` to `measure_distance`. The old identifier keeps resolving: a saved workflow naming `nearest` is rewritten on open and stamped with sourceMigration, because the operation is unchanged and a rename must not refuse work the way a retirement does. `nearest` is a bare adjective, which the naming convention refuses: it names a property of the answer rather than the operation, and the operation is measuring the distance to the closest candidate. No contract change: ports, output, parameters and behaviour are identical."
